    "case_for": "The Sunyaev–Zel'dovich effects turned the interaction of hot plasma with the cosmic microwave background into a durable observational tool for cosmology. Their extensive use and confirmation make this a mature achievement whose importance rests on what it lets us learn about the universe, not on the elegance of the prediction alone.",
    "case_against": "The prediction is jointly associated with Yakov Zel'dovich, while this ballot credits only Sunyaev. That makes fair attribution the central reservation, and the citation must not imply sole authorship of the original work.",
